<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot beef trade 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility carcasses generally</p>
<p>steady compared to last market test. Demand and offerings light</p>
<p>to moderate. - USDA</p>
<p>COW &amp; BULL CARCASS FOB OMAHA  3.0 LOADS REPORTED.</p>
<p>			  Lds     Price Range    Latest Estb. Mkt.</p>
<p>UT,brk 2-4 450#/up  1.0   67.00		 67.00</p>
<p>UT,bng 1-3 400#/up  2.0   71.00		 71.00</p>
<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up				  71.00 - 72.00 C</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up				  unq</p>
<p>BONELESS PROCESSING BEEF/BEEF TRIMMINGS  219.0  Loads Reported.</p>
<p>Lean boneless beef mostly steady to $1.50 lower; 85% steady to</p>
<p>weak; 75% generally steady; 65% steady to firm. Demand and</p>
<p>offerings moderate. Beef trimmings generally steady on fairly</p>
<p>good demand and moderate to heavy offerings.</p>
<p>FOB OMAHA BASIS:</p>
<p>Chm Ln   Lds     Price Range		     Wtavg</p>
