<p>90% fr   24  101.0 - 102.0		     101.29</p>
<p>85% fr    2	     97.0			97.00</p>
<p>**ABCDE after quotes represents days since last actual market test. Quotes are dropped after 5 days of no test or before if they no longer reflect current market conditions.**</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
